In short:

CAL/MSP/MEC/FLA/PPL/MTK -> always false
Other non-special prefixes    -> true
BNA/OHO                        -> true when CODE + DATE match
NTL/OEB                        -> true when CODE + DATE do not match


For BRAVO:

ATL/CAL/CHS/ETX/FLA/GSO/KLC/MPC/NEX/NTL/NYC/PPL/PVS/RAM/STM -> always false
Other non-special prefixes                                     -> true
SLC/BNA/OEB/PNX/BHM                                            -> true when CODE + DATE match
OHO                                                            -> true when CODE + DATE do not match
